1
00:00:04,866 --> 00:00:07,966
Eating slowly throughout a meal can be difficult.

2
00:00:08,366 --> 00:00:10,100
We present Earinter

3
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:15,066
a closed- loop system using commodity earbuds to regulate eating pace in daily meals.

4
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:21,433
For sensing, its bone-conduction sensor can capture chewing vibrations.

5
00:00:22,166 --> 00:00:29,033
For reasoning, the smartphone detects chews and infers swallows from inter-chew intervals, estimating eating pace in real time.

6
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:35,666
considering meal contexts, We designed just-in-time interventions with wizard-of-oz pilots.

7
00:00:36,266 --> 00:00:38,233
When fast eating is detected,

8
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:42,500
Earinter delivers just-in-time audio prompts within a specific mechanism.

9
00:00:43,166 --> 00:00:47,300
It keeps monitoring as you adjust, staying quiet when your pace is on track.

10
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:51,466
A summary also supports reflection.

11
00:00:52,533 --> 00:00:53,900
In our field study, 

12
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:58,700
Earinter helped users increase chews per swallow and eat more slowly during daily meals.

